    {
      "id": "shortcuts",
      "title": "Shortcuts",
      "content": "Driving, as the keys start. The controls page can change them.\nW or Up — gas\nS or Down — brake\nA or Left — steer left\nD or Right — steer right\nSpace — hand brake\n. — shift up\n, — shift down (from first or drive, neutral; from neutral, stopped, reverse)\nQ — look left, held, about 80 degrees\nE — look right, held, about 80 degrees\nZ — look far left, held, about 165 degrees\nC — look far right, held, about 165 degrees\nF1 — far behind\nF2 — close behind\nF3 — inside\nF4 — front bumper\nEsc — pause\n` — console\nEnter or Esc — leave the finish\n\nMenus\nW or Up, S or Down — move\nA or Left, D or Right — a slider\nEnter — choose\nEsc — back\n\nGarage\nN — newspaper\nM — city map\nR — radio\nP — paint\nD — free roam\nG — gas station\nX — calendar\nQ — menu\nI — car stats\nT — tire machine\nW — wheels\nL — spare parts\nB — bookshelf\nH — under the hood\nA — transmission\nU — under the car\nC — cars\n` — console\nRight-drag — look around\nWheel — zoom\nCtrl+0 — reset the zoom (Cmd+0 on a Mac)\n\nCity map\n0 — garage\n1 — drive-in\n2 — gas station\n3 — Royal Rods\nEsc — hang it up\n\nCars\n1–9, and 0 for the 10th — pick one\nS or Enter — switch to it\nL — sell\nF or Esc — close\nUp or Down — the asking price\nO or Enter — offer, or take the offer\nN or Esc — never, or refuse\n\nSpare parts\n1–9, and 0 for the 10th — pick one\nS or Enter — sell\nEsc — close\n\nBookshelf\n1–9, and 0 for the 10th — open that book\nEsc — back, then close\n\nUnder the hood\nP — parts\nW — plug wires\nB — belt\nT — tune\nEsc — close the hood\nRight-drag — look around\nWheel — zoom\n\nTune\nA or Up — advance\nR or Down — retard\nEsc — done\n\nTransmission\n1 and 2 — the bellhousing bolts\nG — select a gearbox\nEsc — back to the garage\n\nUnder the car\n1 — exhaust manifolds\n2 — exhaust\n3 — muffler\n4 — left muffler\n5 — rear end\n6 — springs\n7 — shocks\nEsc — back to the garage\nRight-drag — look around\nWheel — zoom\n\nNewspaper\nU or C — used cars\nP or A — parts\nEsc — back\n\nDrive-in\nG — back to the garage\nD — town cruise\nO — opponents\nEnter — race the rival waiting there\nH — under that rival's hood\nEsc — back\n\nGas station\nP — take the nozzle, or hang it up\nF — fuel the car, or pull the nozzle back\nG — back to the garage\nD — town cruise\n\nRoyal Rods\nP — parts catalog\nEsc — close the catalog, then leave\nG — back to the garage\nD — town cruise\n\nTown cruise\nSpace or Enter — skip the drive\nF1 — far behind\nF2 — close behind\nF3 — inside\nF4 — front bumper\n` — console\nEsc — leave after a wreck"
